"derecho de modificar estos términos o suspender cuentas que incumplan las "
"normas establecidas."
msgstr ""
"The user undertakes not to make improper use of the website, nor to "
"introduce malicious or fraudulent content. The company reserves the right to "
"modify these terms or suspend accounts that violate established rules."

#: .\usuarios\templates\usuarios\signin.html:169
msgid ""
